                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've been playing this game since PocketSlay on Jornada 680. I've played the Windows version few years ago. \nNow, i've tested this game with my Steam Deck, Steam Machine and a laptop (Win11) . The game works well. It's an addictive game. The rules are very easy to understand. A really game handy game.\n* To fix: Closing the game using the red cross doesn't fully exit sometimes the game on the Windows version.I have to use the windowed close button. On SteamOS, the red cross works fine. \n* To improve in the next updates: \ntext size is too small on any device. (surrender, end of move,...)\nAllow moving the map with arrow keys, instead of mouse drag only. With steam input with a controller it will be easy to setup these key.\nSome sounds are outdated, for this reason i have disabled all sounds :-(\nPlease add Steam Cloud sync if easy to do.",
